            "bodyHinglish": "Kumkum ek clothing store ke billing counter par thi jahan ₹1000 ki jacket par do offers ek saath mil rahe the: Offer f = **10% discount** (f(x) = 0.9x), aur Offer g = **₹50 flat cashback** (g(x) = x − 50). Kumkum ne check kiya:\n- Pehle 10% discount, phir ₹50 off: **g(f(1000))** = g(900) = **₹850**!\n- Pehle ₹50 off, phir 10% discount: **f(g(1000))** = f(950) = **₹855**!\nOrder badalne se final bill badal gaya — matlab **g ∘ f ≠ f ∘ g** (composition commutative nahi hoti)!"
