            "bodyHinglish": "Mansi apne bhai ke saath ek naya board game design kar rahi thi jismein do dice numbers a aur b milakar ek naya score banta hai: **a * b = a + b + ab**! Mansi ne check kiya: \"Kya 2 * 3 aur 3 * 2 barabar hain? Haan, 11 = 11! Kya (1 * 2) * 3 aur 1 * (2 * 3) barabar hain? Haan, 23 = 23! Aur kaunsa number kisi bhi score ko change nahi karta? **0** (kyunki a * 0 = a + 0 + 0 = a)!\"\n\nAise hi kisi bhi do numbers ko combine karke usi set ka ek naya number dene wale rule ko **Binary Operation** kehte hain!"
