            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "- **Partition trick:** Counting equivalence relations on small sets = counting partitions!\n- **Bijection shortcut:** To prove f is bijective AND find f⁻¹, find g with g ∘ f = I_A and f ∘ g = I_B in one go!\n- **Always check domain boundaries:** Fractions on R for relations, denominator ≠ 0 for rational functions and binary inverses.",
