            "bodyHinglish": "Nita apne robotics lab mein ek robotic arm ke joint-angle software ko debug kar rahi thi. Code mein likha tha: angle = arcsin(sin(120°)). Nita ne socha output 120° aayega, par screen par **60°** aaya! Kyun? Kyunki sin(120°) = √3/2 hota hai, aur arcsin ki principal branch **[−90°, +90°]** hai — isliye arcsin(√3/2) hamesha **60° (π/3)** lautata hai, 120° nahi!"
