            "heading": "1. Graphs of Principal Value Branches",
            "headingHinglish": "1. Graphs of Principal Value Branches",
            "body": "1. **y = sin⁻¹ x** (Domain [−1, 1], Range [−π/2, π/2], **strictly increasing**, passes through (−1, −π/2), (0, 0), (1, π/2)):\n```\n        y\n   π/2  │         * (1, π/2)\n        │       /\n     0 -┼------*------- x\n        │    / (0,0)\n  -π/2  │  * (-1, -π/2)\n```\n\n2. **y = cos⁻¹ x** (Domain [−1, 1], Range [0, π], **strictly decreasing**, passes through (−1, π), (0, π/2), (1, 0)):\n```\n        y\n     π  │ * (-1, π)\n        │   \\\n   π/2  │    * (0, π/2)\n        │      \\\n     0 -┼-------*------ x\n               (1, 0)\n```\n\n3. **y = tan⁻¹ x** (Domain R, Range (−π/2, π/2), **strictly increasing**, horizontal asymptotes at y = +π/2 and y = −π/2):\n```\n        y\n   π/2  │ - - - - - - - (asymptote y = π/2)\n        │         ___/\n     0 -┼-------*------- x\n        │   ___/\n  -π/2  │ - - - - - - - (asymptote y = -π/2)\n```",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **y = sin⁻¹ x** (Domain [−1, 1], Range [−π/2, π/2], **strictly increasing**, passes through (−1, −π/2), (0, 0), (1, π/2)):\n```\n        y\n   π/2  │         * (1, π/2)\n        │       /\n     0 -┼------*------- x\n        │    / (0,0)\n  -π/2  │  * (-1, -π/2)\n```\n\n2. **y = cos⁻¹ x** (Domain [−1, 1], Range [0, π], **strictly decreasing**, passes through (−1, π), (0, π/2), (1, 0)):\n```\n        y\n     π  │ * (-1, π)\n        │   \\\n   π/2  │    * (0, π/2)\n        │      \\\n     0 -┼-------*------ x\n               (1, 0)\n```\n\n3. **y = tan⁻¹ x** (Domain R, Range (−π/2, π/2), **strictly increasing**, horizontal asymptotes at y = +π/2 and y = −π/2):\n```\n        y\n   π/2  │ - - - - - - - (asymptote y = π/2)\n        │         ___/\n     0 -┼-------*------- x\n        │   ___/\n  -π/2  │ - - - - - - - (asymptote y = -π/2)\n```"
