            "heading": "2. Standard Trigonometric Substitutions for Simplification",
            "headingHinglish": "2. Standard Trigonometric Substitutions for Simplification",
            "body": "| Expression | Best Substitution | Resulting Identity |\n|---|---|---|\n| **√(a² − x²)** | x = **a sin θ** or **a cos θ** | a cos θ or a sin θ |\n| **√(a² + x²)** | x = **a tan θ** or **a cot θ** | a sec θ or a cosec θ |\n| **√(x² − a²)** | x = **a sec θ** or **a cosec θ** | a tan θ or a cot θ |\n| **√[(a − x)/(a + x)]** | x = **a cos 2θ** | tan θ |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Expression | Best Substitution | Resulting Identity |\n|---|---|---|\n| **√(a² − x²)** | x = **a sin θ** or **a cos θ** | a cos θ or a sin θ |\n| **√(a² + x²)** | x = **a tan θ** or **a cot θ** | a sec θ or a cosec θ |\n| **√(x² − a²)** | x = **a sec θ** or **a cosec θ** | a tan θ or a cot θ |\n| **√[(a − x)/(a + x)]** | x = **a cos 2θ** | tan θ |"
