            "heading": "2. Complete Formula for tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y (All Cases!)",
            "headingHinglish": "2. Complete Formula for tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y (All Cases!)",
            "body": "For **x > 0, y > 0**:\n- If **xy < 1:** tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **tan⁻¹[ (x + y) / (1 − xy) ]**\n- If **xy = 1:** tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **π/2**\n- If **xy > 1:** tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **π + tan⁻¹[ (x + y) / (1 − xy) ]**\n\nFor **x < 0, y < 0** and **xy > 1:**\n- tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **−π + tan⁻¹[ (x + y) / (1 − xy) ]**!\n\n### Complete Formula for 2 tan⁻¹x (All x ∈ R!):\n- For **sin⁻¹[2x/(1+x²)]**:\n  - |x| ≤ 1: **2 tan⁻¹x**\n  - x > 1: **π − 2 tan⁻¹x**\n  - x < −1: **−π − 2 tan⁻¹x**\n- For **cos⁻¹[(1−x²)/(1+x²)]**:\n  - x ≥ 0: **2 tan⁻¹x**\n  - x < 0: **−2 tan⁻¹x**",
            "bodyHinglish": "For **x > 0, y > 0**:\n- If **xy < 1:** tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **tan⁻¹[ (x + y) / (1 − xy) ]**\n- If **xy = 1:** tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **π/2**\n- If **xy > 1:** tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **π + tan⁻¹[ (x + y) / (1 − xy) ]**\n\nFor **x < 0, y < 0** and **xy > 1:**\n- tan⁻¹x + tan⁻¹y = **−π + tan⁻¹[ (x + y) / (1 − xy) ]**!\n\n### Complete Formula for 2 tan⁻¹x (All x ∈ R!):\n- For **sin⁻¹[2x/(1+x²)]**:\n  - |x| ≤ 1: **2 tan⁻¹x**\n  - x > 1: **π − 2 tan⁻¹x**\n  - x < −1: **−π − 2 tan⁻¹x**\n- For **cos⁻¹[(1−x²)/(1+x²)]**:\n  - x ≥ 0: **2 tan⁻¹x**\n  - x < 0: **−2 tan⁻¹x**"
