            "bodyHinglish": "To sum **Σ tan⁻¹(T_r)**, rewrite each term T_r in the form **(A − B) / (1 + AB)** so that:\n**tan⁻¹[ (A − B) / (1 + AB) ] = tan⁻¹(A) − tan⁻¹(B)**!\nMost famous pattern: **1 / (1 + r + r²) = [ (r + 1) − r ] / [ 1 + r(r + 1) ]**\n⇒ **tan⁻¹[ 1 / (1 + r + r²) ] = tan⁻¹(r + 1) − tan⁻¹(r)**!"
