            "bodyHinglish": "Saif ek secret-code puzzle bana raha tha jahan 2-letter message vector X ko ek 2 × 2 encoding matrix A se multiply karke coded message Y = AX banaya jata hai! Friend ko message decode karne ke liye X = A⁻¹Y nikalna hota hai! Saif ne dekha: har matrix ka inverse nahi hota — par jis matrix ka inverse exist karta hai, uska inverse bilkul **UNIQUE** hota hai!"
