            "bodyHinglish": "- **Matrix equation shortcut:** Determine order of X first, then set up linear equations.\n- **Polynomial-to-inverse trick:** If A² + pA + qI = O (q ≠ 0), multiply by A⁻¹ → **A⁻¹ = −(1/q)(A + pI)**!\n- **Induction on Aⁿ:** Check n = 1, assume n = k, multiply Aᵏ · A to verify n = k + 1."
