            "bodyHinglish": "Akshay apne gaon mein land surveyor ke saath khet ka area napne gaya tha. Surveyor ne khet ke teen konon ke coordinates map par mark kiye: (1, 0), (6, 0), aur (4, 3). Akshay ne socha ki ab lambi Heron's formula ya distance formula lagani padegi — par surveyor ne sirf ek 3 × 3 determinant likha, 10 seconds mein expand kiya, aur exact area **7.5 sq units** bata diya!"
