            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Amardeep apne cryptography project mein 3 × 3 matrices ke inverses nikalte waqt elementary row operations ke lambe steps se thak gaya tha. Uske senior ne ek single clean formula dikhaya: **A⁻¹ = (1 / |A|) · adj(A)**! Pehle determinant |A| check karo: agar |A| = 0 hai toh turant pata chal gaya ki inverse exist hi nahi karta (**Singular Matrix!**); aur agar |A| ≠ 0 hai, toh cofactors ka transpose (**Adjoint**) nikal kar |A| se divide kar do — seedha exact **A⁻¹**!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Amardeep apne cryptography project mein 3 × 3 matrices ke inverses nikalte waqt elementary row operations ke lambe steps se thak gaya tha. Uske senior ne ek single clean formula dikhaya: **A⁻¹ = (1 / |A|) · adj(A)**! Pehle determinant |A| check karo: agar |A| = 0 hai toh turant pata chal gaya ki inverse exist hi nahi karta (**Singular Matrix!**); aur agar |A| ≠ 0 hai, toh cofactors ka transpose (**Adjoint**) nikal kar |A| se divide kar do — seedha exact **A⁻¹**!"
