            "bodyHinglish": "Anirban apne college linear-algebra tournament mein ek super-smart shortcut dekh raha tha: Question mein do 3 × 3 matrices A aur B diye the aur poocha tha — \"Pehle product AB nikalo, phir uska use karke ek 3-variable system solve karo!\" Jab Anirban ne AB multiply kiya, toh **AB = 8 I** nikal aaya! Bina ek bhi cofactor nikale turant **A⁻¹ = (1/8) B** mil gaya aur 30 seconds mein poora system solve ho gaya!"
