            "heading": "Naye Shabd (Chapter Formula Snapshot)",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye Shabd (Chapter Formula Snapshot)",
            "body": "- **Scaling & Product:** |kA| = **kⁿ |A|**; |AB| = |A||B|; |A'| = |A|; |A⁻¹| = 1/|A|.\n- **Adjoint:** A(adj A) = |A|I; **|adj A| = |A|^(n−1)**; A⁻¹ = (1/|A|) adj(A).\n- **Product-to-Inverse Shortcut:** If **AB = kI** (k ≠ 0), then **A⁻¹ = (1/k) B** and **B⁻¹ = (1/k) A**!\n- **Area:** Δ = (1/2) |det([ x₁ y₁ 1 ; x₂ y₂ 1 ; x₃ y₃ 1 ])| (use ±Δ when area is given!).",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Scaling & Product:** |kA| = **kⁿ |A|**; |AB| = |A||B|; |A'| = |A|; |A⁻¹| = 1/|A|.\n- **Adjoint:** A(adj A) = |A|I; **|adj A| = |A|^(n−1)**; A⁻¹ = (1/|A|) adj(A).\n- **Product-to-Inverse Shortcut:** If **AB = kI** (k ≠ 0), then **A⁻¹ = (1/k) B** and **B⁻¹ = (1/k) A**!\n- **Area:** Δ = (1/2) |det([ x₁ y₁ 1 ; x₂ y₂ 1 ; x₃ y₃ 1 ])| (use ±Δ when area is given!)."
