            "headingHinglish": "2. Master Adjoint Identities (For n × n Non-Singular Matrix A)",
            "body": "1. **|adj A| = |A|^(n−1)**\n2. **adj(AB) = (adj B)(adj A)** (Reversal Law!)\n3. **adj(A') = (adj A)'**\n4. **adj(kA) = k^(n−1) · adj(A)**\n5. **Nested Adjoint (SUPER IMPORTANT!):**\n   - **adj(adj A) = |A|^(n−2) · A**\n   - **|adj(adj A)| = |A|^((n−1)²)**   *(For n = 3: **|adj(adj A)| = |A|⁴**!)*\n   - In general, k nested adjoints: **|adj(adj(...adj A))| = |A|^((n−1)ᵏ)**!\n6. **adj(A⁻¹) = (adj A)⁻¹ = A / |A|**",
            "bodyHinglish": "1. **|adj A| = |A|^(n−1)**\n2. **adj(AB) = (adj B)(adj A)** (Reversal Law!)\n3. **adj(A') = (adj A)'**\n4. **adj(kA) = k^(n−1) · adj(A)**\n5. **Nested Adjoint (SUPER IMPORTANT!):**\n   - **adj(adj A) = |A|^(n−2) · A**\n   - **|adj(adj A)| = |A|^((n−1)²)**   *(For n = 3: **|adj(adj A)| = |A|⁴**!)*\n   - In general, k nested adjoints: **|adj(adj(...adj A))| = |A|^((n−1)ᵏ)**!\n6. **adj(A⁻¹) = (adj A)⁻¹ = A / |A|**"
