            "bodyHinglish": "- **Continuity at x = c:** **LHL = RHL = f(c)** (all finite).\n- **Always continuous:** Polynomials, sin x, cos x, eˣ, |x|, and their compositions.\n- **Greatest integer [x]:** Discontinuous at every integer c ∈ Z (LHL = c − 1, RHL = c)."
