        "summaryHinglish": "Bhumi apne hill-station ski slope par ek smooth parabolic curve y = x² aur ek sharp V-shaped ramp y = |x| ko compare kar rahi thi: dono curves bina toote (continuous!) hain, par y = |x| ke bilkul neec",
