            "body": "Bhumi apne hill-station ski slope par ek smooth parabolic curve y = x² aur ek sharp V-shaped ramp y = |x| ko compare kar rahi thi: dono curves bina toote (continuous!) hain, par y = |x| ke bilkul neeche x = 0 par **ek teekha kona (sharp corner)** hai — left se slope −1 aata hai aur right se achanak +1 ho jata hai! Wahan koi unique tangent line nahi ban sakti — isliye **y = |x| x = 0 par continuous hai, par DIFFERENTIABLE NAHI hai!**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Bhumi apne hill-station ski slope par ek smooth parabolic curve y = x² aur ek sharp V-shaped ramp y = |x| ko compare kar rahi thi: dono curves bina toote (continuous!) hain, par y = |x| ke bilkul neeche x = 0 par **ek teekha kona (sharp corner)** hai — left se slope −1 aata hai aur right se achanak +1 ho jata hai! Wahan koi unique tangent line nahi ban sakti — isliye **y = |x| x = 0 par continuous hai, par DIFFERENTIABLE NAHI hai!**"
