            "heading": "2. Master Derivative Table (ITF, Exponential & Logarithmic)",
            "headingHinglish": "2. Master Derivative Table (ITF, Exponential & Logarithmic)",
            "body": "| Function y | Derivative dy/dx | Domain of Validity |\n|---|---|---|\n| **sin⁻¹ x** | **1 / √(1 − x²)** | x ∈ (−1, 1) |\n| **cos⁻¹ x** | **−1 / √(1 − x²)** | x ∈ (−1, 1) |\n| **tan⁻¹ x** | **1 / (1 + x²)** | x ∈ R |\n| **cot⁻¹ x** | **−1 / (1 + x²)** | x ∈ R |\n| **sec⁻¹ x** | **1 / [ |x| √(x² − 1) ]** | |x| > 1 |\n| **cosec⁻¹ x** | **−1 / [ |x| √(x² − 1) ]** | |x| > 1 |\n| **eˣ** | **eˣ** | x ∈ R |\n| **aˣ** (a > 0) | **aˣ · ln a** | x ∈ R |\n| **ln x** (logₑ x) | **1 / x** | x > 0 |\n| **logₐ x** | **1 / (x · ln a)** | x > 0 |\n\n*(Notice the symmetry: Every **\"co-\"** function — cos⁻¹, cot⁻¹, cosec⁻¹ — has a **MINUS (−)** sign!)*",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Function y | Derivative dy/dx | Domain of Validity |\n|---|---|---|\n| **sin⁻¹ x** | **1 / √(1 − x²)** | x ∈ (−1, 1) |\n| **cos⁻¹ x** | **−1 / √(1 − x²)** | x ∈ (−1, 1) |\n| **tan⁻¹ x** | **1 / (1 + x²)** | x ∈ R |\n| **cot⁻¹ x** | **−1 / (1 + x²)** | x ∈ R |\n| **sec⁻¹ x** | **1 / [ |x| √(x² − 1) ]** | |x| > 1 |\n| **cosec⁻¹ x** | **−1 / [ |x| √(x² − 1) ]** | |x| > 1 |\n| **eˣ** | **eˣ** | x ∈ R |\n| **aˣ** (a > 0) | **aˣ · ln a** | x ∈ R |\n| **ln x** (logₑ x) | **1 / x** | x > 0 |\n| **logₐ x** | **1 / (x · ln a)** | x > 0 |\n\n*(Notice the symmetry: Every **\"co-\"** function — cos⁻¹, cot⁻¹, cosec⁻¹ — has a **MINUS (−)** sign!)*"
