        "summaryHinglish": "Deepali ek real-analysis seminar mein ek function dekh rahi thi: f(x) = (x − 1) |x − 1|! Pehle laga ki |x − 1| ki wajah se yeh x = 1 par non-differentiable hoga — par jab usne LHD aur RHD nikala, toh ",
