            "bodyHinglish": "Divyansh apne cycling velodrome (curved track) ke design model ko dekh raha tha: agar koi cyclist tezi se mod par phisal jaye, toh woh seedha track ke **tangent** ki disha mein jata hai, jabki track ka centripetal support force theek **90° andar (normal)** ki disha mein lagta hai! Calculus mein dy/dx humein har ek point (x₀, y₀) par in dono lines ki exact equations de deta hai!"
