            "bodyHinglish": "If two curves intersect at point P(x₀, y₀) with tangent slopes **m₁** and **m₂**, then the acute angle θ between them is:\n**tan θ = | (m₁ − m₂) / (1 + m₁ m₂) |**\n- **Curves touch each other (θ = 0°):** **m₁ = m₂**.\n- **Curves cut orthogonally (θ = 90°):** **m₁ · m₂ = −1**!"
