            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Geetanjali apne papa ke precision machine shop mein thi jahan 7 cm radius wale metal spheres banaye jaate the. Quality inspector ne bataya: \"Agar radius naapne mein sirf **0.02 cm** ka error ho jaye, toh volume mein kitna error aayega?\" Geetanjali ne poora (7.02)³ nahi nikala — usne differential formula **ΔV ≈ (dV/dr) · Δr = 4πr² Δr** lagaya aur 5 seconds mein exact error **3.92π cm³** nikal liya!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Geetanjali apne papa ke precision machine shop mein thi jahan 7 cm radius wale metal spheres banaye jaate the. Quality inspector ne bataya: \"Agar radius naapne mein sirf **0.02 cm** ka error ho jaye, toh volume mein kitna error aayega?\" Geetanjali ne poora (7.02)³ nahi nikala — usne differential formula **ΔV ≈ (dV/dr) · Δr = 4πr² Δr** lagaya aur 5 seconds mein exact error **3.92π cm³** nikal liya!"
