            "body": "*(Warning: Agar deg P(x) ≥ deg Q(x) ho, toh PEHLE polynomial long division karke proper fraction banao!)*\n\n| Denominator Factor Form | Partial Fraction Decomposition |\n|---|---|\n| **(x − a)(x − b)** (distinct linear) | A / (x − a) + B / (x − b) |\n| **(x − a)²** (repeated linear) | A / (x − a) + B / (x − a)² |\n| **(x − a)(x² + bx + c)** (irreducible quadratic) | A / (x − a) + (Bx + C) / (x² + bx + c) |",
            "bodyHinglish": "*(Warning: Agar deg P(x) ≥ deg Q(x) ho, toh PEHLE polynomial long division karke proper fraction banao!)*\n\n| Denominator Factor Form | Partial Fraction Decomposition |\n|---|---|\n| **(x − a)(x − b)** (distinct linear) | A / (x − a) + B / (x − b) |\n| **(x − a)²** (repeated linear) | A / (x − a) + B / (x − a)² |\n| **(x − a)(x² + bx + c)** (irreducible quadratic) | A / (x − a) + (Bx + C) / (x² + bx + c) |"
