            "body": "- **FTC:** ∫ₐᵇ f(x) dx = F(b) − F(a) (no + C).\n- **King's Property:** ∫ₐᵇ f(x) dx = ∫ₐᵇ f(a + b − x) dx → add both to cancel messy numerators!\n- **Symmetric limits (−a to a):** Odd ⇒ **0**; Even ⇒ **2 ∫₀ᵃ f(x) dx**.\n- **Modulus |x − c|:** Split at x = c using P₂!",
