        "summaryHinglish": "Kundan apne shehar ke elliptical cricket stadium ka turf area check kar raha tha: major semi-axis a = 80 m aur minor semi-axis b = 60 m. Coach ne kaha, \"Circle ka area πr² sab jaante hain, par Ellipse",
