        "summaryHinglish": "Lalit ek arch-bridge ka CAD drawing bana raha tha jahan parabolic arch y² = 4x ko ek diagonal support beam y = 2x kaat rahi thi. Beam aur arch ke beech ka exact concrete area nikalne ke liye Lalit ne ",
