            "bodyHinglish": "Lalit ek arch-bridge ka CAD drawing bana raha tha jahan parabolic arch **y² = 4x** ko ek diagonal support beam **y = 2x** kaat rahi thi. Beam aur arch ke beech ka exact concrete area nikalne ke liye Lalit ne pehle dono ke **intersection points** nikale (0, 0) aur (1, 2), phir **∫₀¹ (Upper Curve − Lower Line) dx** integrate karke exact area **1/3 sq units** nikal liya!"
