            "bodyHinglish": "Madhu ek park mein patti (leaf) ke aakaar ka flowerbed design kar rahi thi jo do parabolas **y² = 4x** aur **x² = 4y** ke beech banta hai! Dono curves (0, 0) aur (4, 4) par milte hain — aur **∫₀⁴ (2√x − x²/4) dx** ne turant exact area **16/3 sq units** de diya (square 4 × 4 = 16 ka theek ek-tihai!)!"
