            "bodyHinglish": "- **Two curves:** A = ∫ₐᵇ [y_upper − y_lower] dx (split whenever curves cross!).\n- **Two parabolas y² = 4ax & x² = 4ay:** Exact area = **16a² / 3**.\n- **Triangle by integration:** Always verify final area using Chapter 4 determinant formula!"
