            "bodyHinglish": "Manorama ek olympiad calculus workshop mein ek scary-looking integral dekh rahi thi: **∫₁² (x³ + x) dx + ∫₂¹⁰ f⁻¹(y) dy**, jahan f(x) = x³ + x! Cubic ka inverse f⁻¹(y) nikalna toh lagbhag impossible hai — par Manorama ne **Inverse-Function Area Rectangle Identity** lagayi: sum of both areas = **b·f(b) − a·f(a) = 2(10) − 1(2) = 18**! 3 seconds mein answer!"
