            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Monika apne compass se origin (0, 0) par alag-alag radii r ke concentric circles **x² + y² = r²** bana rahi thi. Har circle ka radius alag tha, par sabhi circles ek hi rule follow kar rahe the! Jab Monika ne x² + y² = r² ko sirf ek baar differentiate kiya: **2x + 2y(dy/dx) = 0 ⇒ x + y(dy/dx) = 0**, toh constant **r** bilkul gayab ho gaya — aur ek single 1st-order DE mil gayi jo duniya ke har concentric circle ko represent karti hai!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Monika apne compass se origin (0, 0) par alag-alag radii r ke concentric circles **x² + y² = r²** bana rahi thi. Har circle ka radius alag tha, par sabhi circles ek hi rule follow kar rahe the! Jab Monika ne x² + y² = r² ko sirf ek baar differentiate kiya: **2x + 2y(dy/dx) = 0 ⇒ x + y(dy/dx) = 0**, toh constant **r** bilkul gayab ho gaya — aur ek single 1st-order DE mil gayi jo duniya ke har concentric circle ko represent karti hai!"
