            "bodyHinglish": "Nandita apne biology lab ke bacteria culture ka count note kar rahi thi: shuruat (t = 0) mein 1,00,000 bacteria the, aur 2 ghante mein 10% badh gaye! Sawal tha: \"Kitne ghante mein count 2,00,000 (double) ho jayega?\" Kyunki bacteria ke badhne ka rate present count ke proportional hai (**dN/dt = kN**), ek simple variable-separable DE ne exact doubling time **2 ln 2 / ln(1.1) ≈ 14.55 hours** nikal kar de diya!"
