            "bodyHinglish": "- **Unit vector:** â = a⃗ / |a⃗| (magnitude = 1).\n- **Collinear:** b⃗ = λ a⃗ (parallel, same or opposite sense).\n- **Triangle Law:** AB⃗ + BC⃗ = AC⃗ (closed loop sum = 0⃗).\n- **Vector of length k along a⃗:** k â = k(a⃗ / |a⃗|)."
