            "bodyHinglish": "Pallab apne cycle ka bolt wrench se tight kar raha tha: wrench ki length vector **r⃗** hai aur usne force **F⃗** lagaya. Bolt par lagne wala turning effect (torque **τ⃗ = r⃗ × F⃗**) seedha bolt ke andar ki taraf (dono r⃗ aur F⃗ ke **90° perpendicular**) lagta hai! Yahi hai **Cross Product** ka right-hand screw rule!"
