        "summaryHinglish": "Prabhat apne ghar ki chhat par ek naya flagpole lagwa raha tha. Flagpole ko sidha rakhne ke liye ek guy-wire chhat ke corner se pole ke top tak bandha gaya. Prabhat ne socha — agar chhat ka corner ori",
