            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "- **Line ∩ Plane:** Put general point (x₁+aλ, y₁+bλ, z₁+cλ) into plane equation to solve for λ.\n- **Perpendicular to two lines:** Direction = **b₁⃗ × b₂⃗**.\n- **Plane containing two intersecting/coplanar lines:** Normal = **b₁⃗ × b₂⃗**, point = a₁⃗ (or a₂⃗).",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Line ∩ Plane:** Put general point (x₁+aλ, y₁+bλ, z₁+cλ) into plane equation to solve for λ.\n- **Perpendicular to two lines:** Direction = **b₁⃗ × b₂⃗**.\n- **Plane containing two intersecting/coplanar lines:** Normal = **b₁⃗ × b₂⃗**, point = a₁⃗ (or a₂⃗)."
