            "bodyHinglish": "Rajan ki bakery mein roz subah oven limited ghanto ke liye chalta hai. Usne bread loaves (x) aur cakes (y) ka LPP toh bana liya, par ab sawaal hai — graph par shaded region ke andar toh hazaaron points (x, y) hain! Kya Rajan ko har ek point par profit Z check karna padega? Nahi! Geometry ka ek kamaal ka theorem — **Corner Point Theorem** — kehta hai ki maximum ya minimum value hamesha region ke **corners (vertices)** par hi milti hai!"
