            "heading": "Quick Recap",
            "headingHinglish": "Quick Recap",
            "body": "- **Independent:** P(E ∩ F) = P(E)P(F); also E' and F' are independent.\n- **At least one (independent):** P(A ∪ B) = 1 − P(A')P(B').\n- **Total Probability:** P(A) = Σ P(Eᵢ)P(A | Eᵢ) over a partition {E₁, ..., Eₙ}.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Independent:** P(E ∩ F) = P(E)P(F); also E' and F' are independent.\n- **At least one (independent):** P(A ∪ B) = 1 − P(A')P(B').\n- **Total Probability:** P(A) = Σ P(Eᵢ)P(A | Eᵢ) over a partition {E₁, ..., Eₙ}."
