            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Rashmika ne ek rare bimari ka medical test karwaya jo 99% accurate hai, aur uska result **Positive** aaya! Rashmika ghabra gayi ki kya use 99% pakka wo bimari hai? Doctor ne muskurate hue kaha — \"Nahi! Ye bimari sirf 0.1% logon ko hoti hai, isliye 0.5% healthy logon ka false positive result aana bhi kaafi common hai!\" Result (effect) dekh kar asli cause ki probability ulte raaste se nikaalne ka yahi jaadui formula hai **Bayes' Theorem**!",
            "bodyHinglish": "Rashmika ne ek rare bimari ka medical test karwaya jo 99% accurate hai, aur uska result **Positive** aaya! Rashmika ghabra gayi ki kya use 99% pakka wo bimari hai? Doctor ne muskurate hue kaha — \"Nahi! Ye bimari sirf 0.1% logon ko hoti hai, isliye 0.5% healthy logon ka false positive result aana bhi kaafi common hai!\" Result (effect) dekh kar asli cause ki probability ulte raaste se nikaalne ka yahi jaadui formula hai **Bayes' Theorem**!"
